# testing
#
# Deliberately NOT root-anchored (no leading `/`) — unlike this file's own
# `dist`/`.next/`/`out`/`build` patterns above, `/test-results` etc. were
# originally anchored to the repo root, which never matches
# `apps/web/test-results/` in this ADR 0029 monorepo (Playwright runs with
# `apps/web` as its cwd). Found live: a real `pnpm exec playwright test` run
# left `apps/web/test-results/.last-run.json` untracked and visible to
# `biome check .` (Phase 6, `sdd/ecommerce-admin-template`).
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
playwright/.cache

